  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5332,
      "text": "Also, Pharaoh and those who came before him, and the overturned cities [of Lot] committed the grave sin,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5333,
      "text": "each disobeying the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with a severe punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5334,
      "text": "Indeed, when the floodwater overflowed, We carried you [O humans] in the sailing Ark[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5335,
      "text": "so that We might make it a reminder for you, and that attentive ears may take heed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5336,
      "text": "Then when the Trumpet is blown with a single blast,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5337,
      "text": "and the earth and mountains are lifted up and crushed with a single blow,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5338,
      "text": "on that Day the Inevitable Event will occur.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5339,
      "text": "And the sky will split asunder and will be frail[4] on that day,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5340,
      "text": "with the angels on all its sides, and on that Day, eight [mighty angels] will bear the Throne of your Lord above them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5341,
      "text": "On that day, you will be brought forth [before Allah], and none of your secrets will remain hidden.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5342,
      "text": "As for the one who is given his Record in his right hand, he will say, “Here is my Record, read it!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5343,
      "text": "I was sure that I would meet my reckoning.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5344,
      "text": "So he will be in a pleasant life,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5345,
      "text": "in a lofty garden,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5346,
      "text": "with clustered fruit within his reach.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5347,
      "text": "[They will be told,] “Eat and drink joyfully for what you did[5] in the days gone by.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5348,
      "text": "As for the one who is given his Record in his left hand, he will say, “Would that I had not been given my Record,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5349,
      "text": "nor had I known anything of my reckoning!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5350,
      "text": "Would that it [i.e., death] had been the end of me[6]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5351,
      "text": "My wealth has been of no avail to me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5352,
      "text": "My authority has vanished[7].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5353,
      "text": "[It will be said,] “Seize him and shackle him,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5354,
      "text": "then make him burn in the Blazing Fire,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5355,
      "text": "then tie him up with a chain of seventy cubits long.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5356,
      "text": "For he did not believe in Allah, the Most Great,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 69,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَاقَّةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Haaqqa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Reality",
        "numberOfAyahs": 52,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 567,
      "ruku": 500,
      "hizbQuarter": 227,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
